# Copy to .env (gitignored) or export these in your shell. A real environment
# variable always wins over .env.
#
# With NO keys, crawlgate runs on deterministic stubs with zero model calls --
# and that is the ONLY configuration the security claim is measured in
# (SPEC.md R6). Keys only affect utility.
#
# With both set, the planner and the extractor run on DIFFERENT providers,
# split by authority: the planner never sees page content, the extractor never
# sees your instruction.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
